        "answer": {
          "short": "$1,5,7$.",
          "worked": "An even number ends in $0,2,4,6$ or $8$. Evaluate using these final digits:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}0^2+1&=1\\\\2^2+1&=5\\\\4^2+1&=17\\\\6^2+1&=37\\\\8^2+1&=65\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe possible last digits are $1,5,7$.",
